    "body": "Known related work, added at the user's request: https://github.com/modbog/WazerDesktopFusion360PostProcessor, a community **Autodesk Fusion 360 post processor** for the WAZER Desktop. Its description says it approximates WAM's corner compensation by slowing the feed into corners and speeding up out of them.\n\n**Clean-room status: EXCLUDED. Do not open, read or derive from it.**\n- It's a Fusion post, so under AGENTS.md's Clean-Room Protocol it can't be consulted for CamCraft.\n- Its repository states **no license** (GitHub metadata: none), so by default all rights are reserved.\n\nIt's recorded here only as evidence that corner-feed compensation matters to WAZER users (open question 3). That model has to come from published waterjet literature, not from this post or from WAM's step table. Only the repository's public description and license metadata were read.",
